{"text": "November 29, 2017\n\nDear Friend,\n\n{write to explain that the Oklahoma Speaker\u2019s Ball for 2018 is cancelled. Due to the time demands on\nlegislators required by the recent special session of the Legislature and the uncertainty with respect to time\n{issues of the anticipated second special session, the Speaker's Ball, which was scheduled for January 27,2018,\nwill not occur. The business of the special sessions must take precedence, of course.\n\n\u2018We regret any inconvenience the cancellation may cause, Ifyou have already sent a check for the 2018 Ball,\nyou will receive a full refund,\n\nWe have very much appreciated your support of previous Speaker's Balls. Over the past 11 years, the\nSpeaker's Ball has contributed over $250,000 to various charities in our state. We are pleased to announce\nthat we can afford to make a contribution of $25,000 to Folds of Honor, the charity selected for the 2018 Ball.\n\n1 Please preserve a spot in your budget to support the Speaker's Ball for 2019,\n\nSincerely,\n\nbh chi\n\nRobert McCampbell, Chairman\nOklahoma Speaker's Ball, Inc.",
